      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a world-building project for a story about a new political movement that's trying to completely overhaul how society works. they call themselves \"the realignment.\" i want to write a manifesto for them that lays out their core moral principles. can you help me brainstorm some really strong, radical principles for them that challenge current systems like capitalism and traditional hierarchy?",
